---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Support" description="MLIFT comprehensive support: operator training, maintenance, spare parts, service network, and warranty information for the M16 round bale wrapper.">

<section class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <span>Support</span></div>
    <h1>Support</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== SUPPORT CARDS ===== -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-hdr">
      <span class="sec-tag">We've Got You Covered</span>
      <h2>How Can We Help?</h2>
      <p>Comprehensive after-sales support, training resources, spare parts, and worldwide service.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="support-grid">
      <div class="support-card">
        <div class="sp-icon">&#x1F393;</div>
        <h3>Safety &amp; Training</h3>
        <p>Operator training materials, safety guidelines, and instructional videos to ensure safe, efficient operation of your M16 wrapper.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="sp-link">Request Training</a>
      </div>
      <div class="support-card">
        <div class="sp-icon">&#x1F527;</div>
        <h3>Maintenance &amp; Inspection</h3>
        <p>Preventive maintenance schedules, routine inspection checklists, and technical documentation to keep your machine running at peak performance.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="sp-link">Get Support</a>
      </div>
      <div class="support-card">
        <div class="sp-icon">&#x2699;&#xFE0F;</div>
        <h3>Spare Parts</h3>
        <p>Genuine MLIFT replacement parts available for worldwide shipping. Pre-stretcher rollers, film rolls, hydraulic components, and more.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="sp-link">Order Parts</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== WARRANTY ===== -->
<section class="section section-dark">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
    <div class="sec-hdr">
      <span class="sec-tag">Peace of Mind</span>
      <h2>Warranty &amp; Service</h2>
      <p>Every MLIFT M16 comes with comprehensive warranty coverage and global service support.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:var(--space-4);margin-top:var(--space-5)">
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="v-icon">&#x1F6E1;&#xFE0F;</div>
        <h4>1-Year Full Warranty</h4>
        <p>Complete coverage on all M16 components against manufacturing defects. We stand behind every machine we build.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="v-icon">&#x1F30D;</div>
        <h4>Worldwide Service</h4>
        <p>Remote diagnostic support, technical consultation, and spare parts delivery to any location worldwide.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="v-icon">&#x1F4E6;</div>
        <h4>Fast Parts Delivery</h4>
        <p>Critical spare parts shipped within 48 hours. Comprehensive parts catalog available for all M16 components.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <div class="v-icon">&#x1F4DE;</div>
        <h4>24/7 Tech Support</h4>
        <p>Our technical team is available around the clock for urgent issues. Phone, WhatsApp, or email &mdash; we respond fast.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== FAQ ===== -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
    <div class="sec-hdr">
      <span class="sec-tag">Common Questions</span>
      <h2>Frequently Asked</h2>
      <p>Quick answers to the most common questions about the M16.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-3);margin-top:var(--space-4)">
      <div class="value-card" style="text-align:left;padding:var(--space-3) var(--space-4)">
        <h4 style="color:var(--c-red);margin-bottom:var(--space-1)">What tractors is the M16 compatible with?</h4>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--c-text-muted)">The M16 uses a Cat. II/III three-point hitch, compatible with tractors from 50 HP and above. It supports both front and rear mounting and is Load Sensing ready for modern tractors.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card" style="text-align:left;padding:var(--space-3) var(--space-4)">
        <h4 style="color:var(--c-red);margin-bottom:var(--space-1)">What film does the M16 use?</h4>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--c-text-muted)">The M16 uses standard 750 mm stretch film rolls, widely available worldwide. The 3-patent pre-stretcher ensures consistent film application and efficient use.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card" style="text-align:left;padding:var(--space-3) var(--space-4)">
        <h4 style="color:var(--c-red);margin-bottom:var(--space-1)">How long does delivery take?</h4>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--c-text-muted)">Standard delivery time is 25 days after receipt of deposit. Shipping to major ports worldwide. Contact us for a specific quote to your location.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card" style="text-align:left;padding:var(--space-3) var(--space-4)">
        <h4 style="color:var(--c-red);margin-bottom:var(--space-1)">Do you offer on-site installation?</h4>
        <p style="font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--c-text-muted)">The M16 is designed for plug-and-play operation with clear installation guides. Remote video support is available. On-site installation can be arranged for bulk orders.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ===== CTA ===== -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Need Help?</h2>
    <p>Our support team is ready to assist. Whether you need technical documentation, spare parts, or operational advice &mdash; we're here for you.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="hero-cta">Contact Support</a>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
